Arguments for the specified action.
- create: { script (required), name?, description?, matches?: string[], excludes?: string[], persist?: boolean (default true), runAt?: "document_start"|"document_end"|"document_idle"|"auto", world?: "auto"|"ISOLATED"|"MAIN", allFrames?: boolean (default true), mode?: "auto"|"css"|"persistent"|"once", dnrFallback?: boolean (default true), tags?: string[] }
- list: { query?: string, status?: "enabled"|"disabled", domain?: string }
- get: { id (required) }
- enable/disable: { id (required) }
- update: { id (required), script?, name?, description?, matches?, excludes?, runAt?, world?, allFrames?, persist?, dnrFallback?, tags? }
- remove: { id (required) }
- send_command: { id (required), payload?: string, tabId?: number }
- export: {}
Tip: For a one-off execution that returns a value, use create with args.mode="once". The returned value is included as onceResult in the tool response.
